   "html": "<div layer-name=\"Page\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;padding:40px;flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;min-height:0\">\n  <div layer-name=\"Artboard Header\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs)\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Artboard Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:22px;font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:28px;color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);white-space:nowrap\">Elevation and materials</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Type and File\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-callout);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-callout);color:var(--color-canvas-label-body);white-space:nowrap\">Materials · App/Sources (regularMaterial, bar) · tools/canvas-tokens.json</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Job\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-body);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-body);color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);max-width:900px\">Iter draws flat: paper, cards with a hairline. Only what floats (place card, Add Spot banner, route day picker, sheets, menus) takes a system material and a soft shadow. These are canvas stand-ins for the macOS values; each sits over a coloured backdrop so the translucency shows.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div layer-name=\"Notes\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:var(--spacing-md);align-items:flex-start\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Note / Materials are system-drawn\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs);padding:var(--spacing-md);flex-shrink:0;width:360px;background:var(--color-canvas-note-background);border:1px solid var(--color-canvas-note-border);border-radius:var(--radius-control)\">\n      <div layer-name=\"Note Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">Materials are system-drawn</div>\n      <div layer-name=\"Note Body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">regularMaterial and bar are Apple materials. Snapshots draw them as flat background/content; the fills here approximate the macOS 26 look and are canvas tokens, not app tokens.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
   "lines": 13,
   "partial": true
  },
